{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-01/1061154/block/singleImage/3253304/df/01KERVKJPXX59KZZY9HVN7HPTH.JPG?updatedAt=1793331023\"/><figcaption>伊利沙伯醫院。(資料圖片)</figcaption></figure><p>油麻地發生夫妻爭執襲擊案。 今日（30日）早上7時37分，油麻地彌敦道458號美景大廈一對夫婦疑因離婚問題，在屋內發生激烈爭執，其間妻子情緒激動，用玻璃樽扑向丈夫頭部，丈夫頭破血流紅腫。警方和救援人員接報後趕至現場，由救護車將丈夫清醒送往伊利沙伯醫院治理；警方經調查後，以涉嫌「襲擊他人造成身體傷害」拘捕38歲妻子。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T04:41:46.010814+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":172,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T03:30:23+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T06:40:02.008900+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T04:38:30.414481+00:00","content_hash":"3e89532aeab127970a17a79cdb69253640208fb18fc76d7fd3457042ffb8b7cc","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}